{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f9d6006945d280af93","chatId":"c7a6a37fe2614e10b635d04ccfbebca3","sessionId":null,"userId":69635,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":980,"promptTokens":1451,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218385322135789,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f9d6006945d280af92","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369785488,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f9d6006945d280af92","chatId":"c7a6a37fe2614e10b635d04ccfbebca3","sessionId":null,"userId":69635,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n杰克赶时间参加一个重要的客户会议。在他匆忙出门时，不小心穿了一只棕色的便鞋和一只黑色的正装鞋。在他到办公室的时候，他的同事丹发现了他的鞋子并笑了出来。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，杰克最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 娱乐\nB) 尴尬\nC) 失望\nD) 伤心\nE) 爱护\nF) 伤感\n\n## 问题 2\n杰克为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的同事指出他那双不相配的鞋子\nB) 杰克迟到了会议\nC) 杰克忘记带会议的演示\nD) 他的同事喜欢他的鞋子","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218385322135789,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f9d6006945d280af93","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369785485,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c29358b475744595b1de2b09f39c9a40"}